            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "BWright"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Love it! Used white wine vinegar instead of sherry. Very rich tasting but so easy &amp; fast to make!",
            "datePublished": "2021-03-05T20:16:23.360Z"
          },
          {
            "@type": "Review",
