            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "kurtgrip"
            },
            "reviewBody": "This is a simple yet great recipe. The secret, as always, is in the ingredients. FRESH crab and parmesan reggiano really kick it off. I add scallops and mushrooms when it's a \"special\" dinner.",
            "datePublished": "2011-12-17T13:14:55.727Z"
          },
          {
            "@type": "Review",
            "reviewRating": {
              "@type": "Rating",
              "ratingValue": "5"
            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Dave Faccas"
            },
            "reviewBody": "This recipe is great as-is. No modifications are necessary. This shouldn't be served as main course meal. For the past 5 years we served this, double-size, every year for Christmas Eve. Serve with crackers, or your other favorite bread snack. My only alteration is I add 50% more crab meat. It makes for a more dense crab, if you like it more like hearty stew.",
            "datePublished": "2012-01-22T10:20:27.050Z"
